  "summary": "Mattermost doesn't require role-management authorization when setting the scheme_admin flag on group syncable link and patch endpoints",
  "details": "Mattermost versions 11.6.x \u003c= 11.6.1, 11.5.x \u003c= 11.5.4, 10.11.x \u003c= 10.11.15, 10.11.x \u003c= 10.11.16 fail to require role-management authorization when setting the scheme_admin flag on group syncable link and patch endpoints, which allows a user with group-link permissions to escalate themselves and group members to team or channel admin via crafted API requests. Mattermost Advisory ID: MMSA-2026-00665",
